# Hash-pinned evidence captures must survive a checkout byte for byte.
#
# `prove-career-json-sqlite.ts` refuses to run unless the SHA-256 of
# `live-mfi-012-root.html` matches the one recorded beside it. With
# `core.autocrlf=true` (the Windows default) a normal checkout rewrites LF as CRLF,
# which changes the file's length and hash and would make the proof fail on every
# machine except the one that captured it. `-text` tells git not to translate.
fixtures/careers/*.html -text
fixtures/careers/*.meta.json -text
